ion in the same conversation. The journal-backed view replaces stale CURRENT_TASK tuples; ordinary `find` pages are not state queries. Report a query failure without turning it into a development gate.\\n - Use the assistance `task` actions for prepare/adopt/execution/review/review-decision/step/git/close. Check fact persistence, association and view publication separately; normal state maintenance is not optional. Offer rebuild/link/correct/resolve/defer for unresolved management data, without replaying business work.\\n - Read/search/record operations, stale metadata and equivalent details already authorized need no new confirmation. Report actual service failures and continue independent authorized work; never rerun business work just to obtain a receipt.\\n - For a material deviation from a still-effective workflow commitment, disclose the action, gaps and concrete consequences together and ask once only if that informed choice is unresolved. Silence is not consent.\\n\"}]","started":true,"tool_kind":"custom_tool_call","tool_name":"exec"},"turn_id":"01a0ee3b-a1bd-7393-ace7-9009d7c7f2eb","visible":true},{"answer":null,"artifact_id":null,"artifact_name":null,"attachment_name":null,"availability":"present","content":null,"correlation_id":"exec-9bc4bb6e-af9b-4c84-af2e-cc46ddeec3f2","item_key":"tool:exec-9bc4bb6e-af9b-4c84-af2e-cc46ddeec3f2","kind":"tool","media_type":null,"path":null,"plan":null,"plan_action":null,"presentation_kind":"tool","query":null,"question":null,"related_item_key":null,"result":null,"sequence":186000000,"source_ref":{"byte_end":1136415,"byte_start":1066733,"item_type":"event_msg/item_completed","physical_line_ordinal":186,"rollout_ordinal":185,"source_identity":"01a0ee04-a775-72b3-bd07-04aac804a3b4","timestamp":"2026-09-29T17:34:58.108Z"},"summary":null,"timestamp":"2026-09-29T17:34:58.108Z","tool":{"availability":"present","call_id":"exec-9bc4bb6e-af9b-4c84-af2e-cc46ddeec3f2","completed":true,"input":"{\"command\":[\"C:\\\\Program Files\\\\P