kflow-system/records/events/key-7d77a20c13e828210373966592f635d1bc934146c8652886738331013582aade.json\n \n-- path: `docs/workflow/task-basis/TASK_BASIS-017.md`\n-- revision: `07682c961840e90bf58c5bffd10332d253b00d7a7a84e4211c23e46103c19d09`\n-\n-## 精确读取\n-- `task-context`: current definition, step, gates and dependencies (paged).\n-- `task-read`: exact definition, state, report, review and historical material.\n-- `task-export`: complete retained aggregate; no audit history is discarded.\n+## Management status\n+- Source: 6c21788dc87fa61fb3fd9c7c3e268ae309df3870ec13a2dd718518e297cca812\n+- Health: needs-attention\n+- Unassociated observations: 1\n+- issue-c6639db317c2b990741db0f9: Exact plan/step association is missing or unknown.\n+- Recover with task rebuild/link/correct/resolve/defer. Rebuilding never reruns business commands.\n--- records inventory ---\r\n\r\nName             Count\r\n----             -----\r\nattachments          3\r\nevents              15\r\nevidence-objects     4\r\nlegacy              28\r\nrecords              1\r\ntask-views          13\r\n\r\n--- event kinds ---\r\n\r\nfile                                                                      kind                 task body_kind\r\n----                                                                      ----                 ---- ---------\r\n1790695584703-2500dd0f-bd4f-403f-8587-39e769630464.json                   workflow-observation      \r\n1790695620021-e4dfde65-c0ec-490d-aa31-9edc84cc110d.json                   workflow-observation      \r\n1790695635607-0685a3b3-60f4-4bf1-a59a-0af5b5c64ede.json                   workflow-observation      \r\n1790698182079-cd767cac-e056-47e9-ab56-a1292bac3f84.json                   workflow-observation      \r\n1790698199578-60ddfbce-2f97-471c-b9ee-aad3ab22507a.json                   workflow-observation      \r\n1790698929372-c960be05-37d0-4d6c-962f-74bd71fc640f.json                   workflow-observation      \r\n1790698944545-46903da5-1cd3-4466-aa